      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "NVIDIA and Meta today announced they will partner to expand their work on Muse and the Muse family of models to improve inference and training performance, reflecting popular demand for useful AI agents.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-and-meta-to-expand-collaboration-on-muse-and-muse-family-of-models-amid-robust-growth",
        "source": "NVIDIA Newsroom (Press Releases)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T05:52:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:30.929Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Meta&rsquo;s Muse models and agents, which leverage NVIDIA&rsquo;s infrastructure, have delivered frontier-level benchmark performance and surging consumer downloads since launch.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-and-meta-to-expand-collaboration-on-muse-and-muse-family-of-models-amid-robust-growth",
        "source": "NVIDIA Newsroom (Press Releases)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T05:52:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:30.929Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Meta and NVIDIA intend to further deepen their collaboration by partnering on optimizations across workflows to maximize performance and improve total cost of ownership.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-and-meta-to-expand-collaboration-on-muse-and-muse-family-of-models-amid-robust-growth",
        "source": "NVIDIA Newsroom (Press Releases)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T05:52:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:30.929Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Meta and NVIDIA will also consider additional collaboration opportunities with NVIDIA on its NVIDIA OpenShell Reference Architecture, including NVIDIA OpenShell&trade; for safe deployment and NVIDIA Sentry for monitoring agent behavior.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-and-meta-to-expand-collaboration-on-muse-and-muse-family-of-models-amid-robust-growth",
        "source": "NVIDIA Newsroom (Press Releases)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T05:52:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:30.929Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This announcement reinforces Meta and NVIDIA&rsquo;s strong long-term partnership to support Meta&rsquo;s AI infrastructure ambitions.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-and-meta-to-expand-collaboration-on-muse-and-muse-family-of-models-amid-robust-growth",
        "source": "NVIDIA Newsroom (Press Releases)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T05:52:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:30.929Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Meta will also deploy NVIDIA Spectrum-X&trade; Ethernet networking and BlueField-4 &reg; to support network efficiency and throughput.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-and-meta-to-expand-collaboration-on-muse-and-muse-family-of-models-amid-robust-growth",
        "source": "NVIDIA Newsroom (Press Releases)",
